# Three Tree Scribe, rulings 2024-07-26: "If Three Tree Scribe leaves the battlefield without dying at the same time one or more other
# creatures you control leave the battlefield without dying, its ability will still trigger once for each of those creatures, including
# itself." Bot2's Aetherize returns Bot1's attacking Scribe and Ornithopter to hand in one event (CR 603.6c, 603.10a): two triggers,
# each putting a +1/+1 counter (CR 122.1a) on target creature Bot1 controls, the Memnite that stayed home: it ends with two counters (a 3/3).

